{"id":"n61318-1-9","stage":5,"title":"사치 · 奢侈","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61318-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 여기에서 외식할까?","zh":"今天我们在这家餐厅吃饭吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에서","audio":"/audio/6a94f02253a9c69fca8c.mp3"}},{"text":"외식할까?","meaning":"下馆子，出去吃","explanation":"외식하다：下馆子，出去吃；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"외식하다","audio":"/audio/ce7ba5c872b4a4e748f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69120","senseId":"1","lemma":"외식하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외식할까","audio":"/audio/d1fdca0d1ef69657632a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"ce7ba5c872b4a4e7","term":"외식하다","zh":"下馆子，出去吃","audio":"/audio/ce7ba5c872b4a4e748f4.mp3","entryId":"69120","definition":"不在家吃，在外面买着吃。","pronunciation":["외ː시카다","웨ː시카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec5d8b69bb129d7f971e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61318-1-9-2","ko":"이렇게 비싼 레스토랑은 지금 우리 형편에는 사치인 것 같아.","zh":"以我们目前的经济状况，来这么贵的餐厅有点奢侈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"비싼","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싼","audio":"/audio/f6b099752cceba2e2349.mp3"}},{"text":"레스토랑은","meaning":"西餐厅","explanation":"레스토랑：西餐厅；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"레스토랑","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52573","senseId":"1","lemma":"레스토랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"레스토랑은","audio":"/audio/b15d1a9f9c1864ddc2c4.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"형편에는","meaning":"境况，生活状况，生活情况","explanation":"형편：境况，生活状况，生活情况；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"형편","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86389","senseId":"2","lemma":"형편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형편에는","audio":"/audio/5d8c8e751756f9feb7a6.mp3"}},{"text":"사치인","meaning":"奢侈","explanation":"사치：奢侈；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사치","audio":"/audio/f6be0130da74a05c2ab6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61318","senseId":"1","lemma":"사치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사치인","audio":"/audio/d6e769e969e2dc1cdeec.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"98acfd757481a16c","term":"레스토랑","zh":"西餐厅","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3","entryId":"52573","definition":"出售西餐的餐馆。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"fe4c5d364acf7ca4","term":"형편","zh":"境况，生活状况，生活情况","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3","entryId":"86389","definition":"生活的状态或处境。","pronunciation":["형편"]},{"id":"f6be0130da74a05c","term":"사치","zh":"奢侈","audio":"/audio/f6be0130da74a05c2ab6.mp3","entryId":"61318","definition":"花不必要的钱或使用昂贵的东西，生活得没有分寸。","pronunciation":["사치"]},{"id":"1443a6